


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_6eb700fd:



    voice "RIN_0713"
    rin "「……唉」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_09173311:


    "伦倚着教室的柱子，仰视着天花板。她看上去孱弱无比，仿佛随时都会一屁股摔坐到地上一样。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_6435e3ea:



    voice "FUM_0657"
    fumi "「怎么了？从昨天起就一直唉声叹气的」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_7e38291c:



    voice "RIN_0714"
    rin "「……我大概是被阳菜讨厌了吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_dc77bc41:


    "伦犹豫了一会儿，坦白说出来了。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_faecbb94:



    voice "FUM_0658"
    fumi "「啊啦，难道不是平常那种“关系好到可以吵架”吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_b47513ed:



    voice "RIN_0715"
    rin "「不，这次都算不上吵架，应该说是我单方面惹阳菜生气了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_ea1d9ec0:



    voice "FUM_0659"
    fumi "「到底发生了什么？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_2ad66102:



    voice "RIN_0716"
    rin "「那个……挠了她的痒痒，然后要接吻的时候，结果弹了她的额头，阳菜就不高兴了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_5e4251f2:



    voice "FUM_0660"
    fumi "「诶？诶？诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_f7cb3c8c:


    "文混乱了。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_ca5d5c12:



    voice "RIN_0717"
    rin "「那个……你还记得前天晚上的事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_93bd0ad8:



    voice "FUM_0661"
    fumi "「呃……你们在夏目同学床上胡闹的事吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_abed4763:



    voice "RIN_0718"
    rin "「嗯，就是那个。从那以后阳菜似乎一直在避开我」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_febda68b:



    voice "RIN_0719"
    rin "「……大概是接吻这件事触到了阳菜的逆鳞吧。她不是很讨厌这些事吗」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_45ecee4c:



    voice "FUM_0662"
    fumi "「夏目同学的话是会生气，但并不是会记恨在心的人啊……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_e385bfaa:



    voice "FUM_0663"
    fumi "「……啊！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_ae3fa23c:


    "文突然拍了下手，大声道。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_e1a3ee10:



    voice "FUM_0664"
    fumi "「不对，你搞反了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_b68c2d47:



    voice "RIN_0720"
    rin "「反了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_9332bacd:



    voice "FUM_0665"
    fumi "「嗯。夏目同学不是因为接吻而生气，是因为没接吻而生气」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_1a406554:



    voice "FUM_0666"
    fumi "「最近我总觉得夏目同学有些奇怪，原来是这么一回事啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_b10ca6a6:


    "文独自理清了事情的来龙去脉，点了点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_ada86224:



    voice "RIN_0721"
    rin "「那个，浅生？这是什么意思？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_4b91d132:



    voice "FUM_0667"
    fumi "「绪方同学你那时是真的想要亲上去吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_0d20ee0c:



    voice "RIN_0722"
    rin "「原本是想的，但中途觉得阳菜很可怜。因为那家伙闭紧了双眼，身体也在颤抖……」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_b5748c77:



    voice "FUM_0668"
    fumi "「没做到底才更可怜啊。太残酷了」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_78e2dd44:



    voice "RIN_0723"
    rin "「诶？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_99751a52:



    voice "FUM_0669"
    fumi "「我说啊，夏目同学可是喜欢绪方同学呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_0b4fb1bf:



    voice "RIN_0724"
    rin "「……喜欢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a03_cou2_06_d9aa9329:



    voice "HIN_0919"
    hina "「久等了……回去吧」"
